Week 4 Review: Configuration and Storage
Time: 30 minutes
==================================================================

Answer without looking:

1. ConfigMap: 3 ways to consume; what updates live and what doesn't.
2. Secret: why base64 isn't security; 3 ways to protect secrets.
3. emptyDir vs hostPath vs PVC: lifetime of each.
4. PV, PVC, StorageClass; static vs dynamic provisioning.
5. Access modes and reclaim policies.
6. StatefulSet guarantees; why a headless Service.
7. Job fields: completions, parallelism, backoffLimit, TTL.
8. CronJob schedule and concurrencyPolicy.


DECISION TABLE
--------------
Need                                       Use
-----------------------------------------  ---------------------------
Non-secret settings                        ConfigMap
Passwords, tokens, certs                   Secret (+ external store)
Scratch space shared by containers         emptyDir
Data that must survive pod restarts        PVC
Each replica needs its own disk + name     StatefulSet + volumeClaim-
                                           Templates
Run once to completion                     Job
Run on a schedule                          CronJob


